{%- comment -%}
  The artwork's own name, out of a full wall-art product title:
  "Tablou Decorativ cu Iluminare LED Dansul Sferelor, 60 x 120 cm, 24W, ..." → "Dansul Sferelor".
  Takes the part before the first comma and drops the Romanian type prefix; a
  translated title keeps its own wording up to the comma.

  Accepts:
  - title {String}

  Usage:
  {% render 'alc-wa-name', title: product.title %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign n = title | split: ',' | first | strip
  assign n = n | remove_first: 'Tablou Decorativ cu Iluminare LED ' | remove_first: 'Tablou Decorativ cu iluminare LED ' | remove_first: 'Tablou Decorativ ' | remove_first: 'Tablou '
  echo n | strip | escape
-%}
